OL,3,GNEWSANew service for people with high
OL,4,Ablood pressure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new NHS support programme will be
OL,7,Favailable from October for people
OL,8,Fliving with high blood pressure.
OL,10,FPeople living in parts of Northampton
OL,11,Fand Wellingborough will be able to
OL,12,Faccess the Northamptonshire High Blood
OL,13,FPressure Support Programme, funded by
OL,14,Fthe British Heart Foundation (BHF).
OL,16,FThe programme aims to reach people who
OL,17,Fmay face barriers accessing traditional
OL,18,Fhealthcare services.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
