OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSANew service for people with high
OL,4,Ablood pressure
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Azhar Ali, clinical lead for the
OL,7,Fprogramme at the NHS Northamptonshire
OL,8,FIntegrated Care Board, said the scheme
OL,9,Fwould give practical and "flexible
OL,10,Fsupport" for people to manage their
OL,11,Fblood pressure "in ways that fit around
OL,12,Ftheir lives".
